<title>USA: Coventry Corp Q1 EPS loss flat.</title>
<headline>Coventry Corp Q1 EPS loss flat.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share and membership data)</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997    1996  % Change</p>
<p> Operating revenues		  $    299,345  236,937  26.3%</p>
<p> Operating loss				(2,613) (2,772)   5.7%</p>
<p>Operating earnings (loss) (excluding</p>
<p>gain on asset sales in 1997 and</p>
<p>    termination costs in 1996)	   (8,567)   2,431    N/M</p>
<p> Net loss					  (851)   (968)  12.1%</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) (excluding gain</p>
<p>on asset sales in 1997 and</p>
<p>  termination costs in 1996)	     (4,423)   2,163    N/M</p>
<p> Loss per share				 (0.03)  (0.03)	-</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share (excluding</p>
<p>gain on asset sales in 1997</p>
<p>  and termination costs in 1996)	  (0.13)    0.07    N/M</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>and common equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding				   33,042  32,854   0.6%</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 includes a pre-tax gain of $6 million related to the sale of its HealthAmerica's medical practices.</p>
</text>
